 3. 지침 : 별첨</p><p class="note">첨부: 경기연구원 안전보건관리지침(제정, 2022.12.19).hwp</p>', attachments='{"legacy_id": "gw-000000kcj", "page": "gri/guide/000000kcj.html", "files": ["경기연구원 안전보건관리지침(제정, 2022.12.19).hwp"], "source": "gw.gri.re.kr 재난안전(안내, 의견청취 등)"}'::jsonb where attachments->>'legacy_id' = 'gw-000000kcj' and (board <> 'guide' or attachments->>'page' <> 'gri/guide/000000kcj.html');
